{"title": "Smite", "pageid": 18142, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Smite", "categories": ["Actions", "Spells"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Divine_Smite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Divine_Smite.webp/300px-Divine_Smite.webp, /w/images/d/d5/Divine_Smite.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Divine_Smite.webp/300px-Divine_Smite.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Divine_Smite.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Smite</b> is a category of unique weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attacks\" title=\"Attacks\">attacks</a> that, unlike <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">regular attacks</a>, which generally only cost an <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>, additionally expend <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_slots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell slots\">spell slots</a> (and often a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>) to activate. Though requiring a spell slot, they do <em>not</em> consume the spell slot (nor bonus action, when applicable) on a miss. As they are considered weapon attacks, they can be used with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extra Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Extra_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> and can be used multiple times per turn. The damage they deal is also affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit\" title=\"Critical hit\">critical hits</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_smite_actions\">List of smite actions</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\" style=\"column-width: 18em; list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\">Banishing Smite</a></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/60px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/80px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\">Branding Smite</a></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\">Blinding Smite</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\">Searing Smite</a></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Staggering Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\">Staggering Smite</a></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunderous Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\">Thunderous Smite</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrathful Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\">Wrathful Smite</a></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/24px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/32px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/16px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Smite\" title=\"Lunar Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lunar Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Lunar_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Smite\" title=\"Lunar Smite\">Lunar Smite</a></span> (NPC-exclusive)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Divine_Smite\">Divine Smite</span></h2>\n<p>Notably, Divine Smite functions differently from the other smites. Despite consuming spell slots, Divine Smite is not a spell and does not interact with any effect or ability that only works with spells. Examples include <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/30px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/40px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Vivacious_Cloak_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vivacious_Cloak\" title=\"Vivacious Cloak\">Vivacious Cloak</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tempestuous_Magic\" title=\"Tempestuous Magic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/20px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/30px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/40px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tempestuous Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp/20px-Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Tempestuous_Magic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tempestuous_Magic\" title=\"Tempestuous Magic\">Tempestuous Magic</a>.\n</p><p>Unlike other smite spells, Divine Smite can be configured to trigger automatically on hit inside the Reactions menu with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite_(reaction)\" title=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite_(reaction)\" title=\"Divine Smite (reaction)\">Divine Smite (reaction)</a>. The reaction is split into two options per spell slot level unlocked, one for normal hits called Divine Smite and one for critical hits called Divine Smite: Critical Hit. This means that with level 2 spell slots, there will be four Divine Smite reactions (two per level) that can be configured separately. By default, the Divine Smite: Critical Hit reactions are set to auto-confirm, and the normal Divine Smite reactions are disabled.\n</p><p>Using Divine Smite as a reaction has a number of advantages. It allows Divine Smite to be combined with any melee weapon attack (that is not <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a> itself), such as off-hand attacks, <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_actions\" title=\"Weapon actions\">weapon actions</a> like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/20px-Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/30px-Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/20px-Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a>, or special attacks like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/30px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/20px-Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Great_Weapon_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Great_Weapon_Master:_Bonus_Attack\" title=\"Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack\">Great Weapon Master: Bonus Attack</a>. It can even trigger when using another smite spell. Using Divine Smite directly through the action is less flexible and is equivalent to using the reaction on a basic attack.\n</p><p>When used as a reaction, the only additional resource consumed is the selected level of spell slot. Even though it is configured in the Reactions menu, Divine Smite never consumes a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> resource.\n</p><p>Divine Smite as a reaction cannot be triggered when attacking from invisibility.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_smites\">Other smites</span></h2>\n<p>Other smites cannot be used as reactions and must be used manually; however, Divine Smite can be triggered as a reaction when using other smite spells, allowing for two different smites on a single attack. Other smites also count as proper spells for the purpose of features that interact with them, like <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Ring_H_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Elemental_Infusion\" title=\"Ring of Elemental Infusion\">Ring of Elemental Infusion</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Empowered_Evocation\" title=\"Empowered Evocation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp/20px-Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp/30px-Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp/40px-Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Empowered Evocation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp/20px-Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Empowered_Evocation_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Empowered_Evocation\" title=\"Empowered Evocation\">Empowered Evocation</a>, and can even be affected by Counterspell.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195611\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.098 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5341/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37476/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6697/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expa